codex
The identity checks now use one shared definition. N2’s health monitor accepts latched history only when opted in, while live or unknown bits still stop the run. Successful diagnostic captures stay OPEN and cannot receive N2 acceptance.

The preparation YAML resolves its serial from that same definition, and the bundle will contain a concrete YAML value. I also updated the permission inventory helper because N1 calls it and its old serial check would reject the new unit. No permissions have been applied.
